+/*
+ * The second register window, 0x02031000 and 0x7c long: an I2S receiver wired
+ * to the DAC. The vendor calls it INTER_I2S and drives it with the register
+ * map of sunxi-daudio -- its i2s_reg_labels table @0xc149ce98 and
+ * sunxi_i2s_regmap_config @0xc0ee8a54 (max_register 0x7c) name every field
+ * used here, and sunxi_daudio_{init,set_fmt,set_clkdiv,rxctrl_enable}() give
